                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5b2cc184-8a1a-38d2-93d4-c9abb89edbd2",
                        "entry_id": "07021b9e-2a81-3470-bac7-fc20563f1d4c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "weibliche Person, deren Berufung es ist zu kämpfen, hauptsächlich in Stammesgesellschaften"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2af6503a-5f62-4ed6-b2f6-c79a43ec414a",
                                "sense_id": "5b2cc184-8a1a-38d2-93d4-c9abb89edbd2",
                                "text": "Das Kämpfen ist die Aufgabe der Kriegerin."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "66d591a6-e500-40c7-ba97-99895bb931f9",
                                "sense_id": "5b2cc184-8a1a-38d2-93d4-c9abb89edbd2",
                                "text": "„Ob Boudicca ihre Oberbefehlshaberin war, ob sie als Kriegerin mit in den Kampf zog oder ob sie die Krieger »nur« mit einer bewegenden Rede anfeuerte (wie Cassius Dio es beschreibt), ist nicht klar.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "873fce66-e77c-4f05-b9bf-5c709dc9918f",
                                "sense_id": "5b2cc184-8a1a-38d2-93d4-c9abb89edbd2",
                                "text": "„Es stellt eine Schar allegorischer Kriegerinnen dar (Germania, Marianne, Britannia und andere), die unter der Führung des Erzengels Michael – Schutzpatron der Deutschen – gegen Osten ziehen.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e59a262f-7e9e-480f-a2c3-0141ad643296",
                                "sense_id": "5b2cc184-8a1a-38d2-93d4-c9abb89edbd2",
                                "text": "„Ausgerechnet in London, wo die unbeugsame Kriegerin wütete, ließ Prinz Albert, der Gatte von Königin Victoria, im 19. Jahrhundert eine Bronzestatue anfertigen, die Boudicca mit ihren Töchtern zeigt.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7d22f90d-172e-46bd-b252-eb813c0e8b36",
                        "source_entry_id": "07021b9e-2a81-3470-bac7-fc20563f1d4c",
                        "source_sense_id": "5b2cc184-8a1a-38d2-93d4-c9abb89edbd2",
                        "source_sense_description": "weibliche Person, deren Berufung es ist zu kämpfen, hauptsächlich in Stammesgesellschaften",
                        "target_lang_word": "warrior",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "warrior",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "63cca0dd-1a30-3318-884e-9a86be96f547",
                                        "entry_id": "08a41d82-fbf5-30d7-b99d-dccffd9e3700",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who is actively engaged in battle, conflict or warfare; a soldier or combatant."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ee1d032e-5c09-43e9-85a9-7ecbb6d6148c",
                                                "sense_id": "63cca0dd-1a30-3318-884e-9a86be96f547",
                                                "text": "Orion hit a rabbit once; but though sore wounded it got to the bury, and, struggling in, the arrow caught the side of the hole and was drawn out.[…]. Ikey the blacksmith had forged us a spearhead after a sketch from a picture of a Greek warrior; and a rake-handle served as a shaft."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7ba8db62-6ad4-45b6-9b1c-f8a010b926b9",
                                                "sense_id": "63cca0dd-1a30-3318-884e-9a86be96f547",
                                                "text": "[Link:] Gee, it sure is boring around here.\n [King Harkinian:] My boy, this peace is what all true warriors strive for."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "434aba44-e3e8-341b-99d0-8ffeb7a152d9",
                                        "entry_id": "08a41d82-fbf5-30d7-b99d-dccffd9e3700",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who is aggressively, courageously, or energetically involved in an activity, such as athletics."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ebd798d1-1ed6-4443-ae77-76afff601777",
                        "source_entry_id": "07021b9e-2a81-3470-bac7-fc20563f1d4c",
                        "source_sense_id": "5b2cc184-8a1a-38d2-93d4-c9abb89edbd2",
                        "source_sense_description": "weibliche Person, deren Berufung es ist zu kämpfen, hauptsächlich in Stammesgesellschaften",
                        "target_lang_word": "warrioress",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "warrioress",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "69f4104f-f067-384e-937f-214c8270a8f1",
                                        "entry_id": "4d6df0ea-fd0d-3f2a-b623-208e6a6bcef1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A female warrior."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9c3e2ff8-fc34-4779-860a-7ff713a3993a",
                                                "sense_id": "69f4104f-f067-384e-937f-214c8270a8f1",
                                                "text": "Eftsoones that warriouresse with haughty crest / Did forth issue all ready for the fight […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3639d6c9-c365-4de0-a5b6-f8a9cbccd777",
                                                "sense_id": "69f4104f-f067-384e-937f-214c8270a8f1",
                                                "text": "\"[...] which furnished the battery just below our stand, and which, as soon as the unwieldy old warrioress had occupied the post of honor reserved for her in their midst, sent forth a martial acclaim of welcome that made the earth tremble under our feet, and resounded through the air, shivering, with the strong concussion, more than one pane of glass in the windows of Princess Street far below.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d758384d-aaa1-4d9a-ab04-f142bcd23476",
                                                "sense_id": "69f4104f-f067-384e-937f-214c8270a8f1",
                                                "text": "You can partially or totally ignore the situation for a short while longer, you can become immobilised with fear, or you can become an urban warrior (or warrioress) and groove on the greatest, most spectacular tragicomic, science-'fiction' drama ever enacted on this planet (probably) until the lights go out."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fb78a37e-3a4a-487e-a9de-ec0e8211b8b8",
                        "source_entry_id": "07021b9e-2a81-3470-bac7-fc20563f1d4c",
                        "source_sense_id": "5b2cc184-8a1a-38d2-93d4-c9abb89edbd2",
                        "source_sense_description": "weibliche Person, deren Berufung es ist zu kämpfen, hauptsächlich in Stammesgesellschaften",
                        "target_lang_word": "guerrière",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "guerrière",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4c7b7633-64d8-332a-8d93-3358a91ae664",
                                        "entry_id": "b63adb4d-307b-3c68-98a7-ce3818daad4e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Celle qui fait la guerre et qui s’y plaît."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a83b782a-6d5c-49c5-a91b-a9a160469f12",
                                                "sense_id": "4c7b7633-64d8-332a-8d93-3358a91ae664",
                                                "text": "Elle était la femelle primitive, la guerrière énamourée, obscène, explosible, avec tout l’apport des cérébralités vicieuses superposées par couches brûlantes depuis des siècles que sévit l’imbécile mysticisme ennemi de l’acte brutal et simple."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "46f83f0f-5901-4663-89bb-a75d18bdcc2c",
                                                "sense_id": "4c7b7633-64d8-332a-8d93-3358a91ae664",
                                                "text": "Elles en font des chasseresses audacieuses comme elles-mêmes, des guerrières qui se mesurent sans crainte avec les grands fauves, […]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "41611ead-6cdf-3cc4-b02b-72ddbff77fe8",
                                        "entry_id": "b63adb4d-307b-3c68-98a7-ce3818daad4e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Militante féministe."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c58f2e27-8870-41f2-8b8b-c2526e23a628",
                                                "sense_id": "41611ead-6cdf-3cc4-b02b-72ddbff77fe8",
                                                "text": "Guerrières sans armes : l’essor des militantes. C’est avec dégoût ou avec fierté – selon que l’on estime ou non en faire partie – que l’on utilise aujourd’hui le terme de militante."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
